set device-group CLD-DG-AWS-DEDICATED pre-rulebase security rules APP1-NLB-WEB group-tag INBOUND
set device-group CLD-DG-AWS-DEDICATED pre-rulebase security rules APP1-NLB-WEB tag [ INBOUND APP1 ALB BASELINE EXAMPLE ]
