set device-group CLD-DG-AWS-DEDICATED pre-rulebase security rules APP1-NLB-WEB disabled no
set device-group CLD-DG-AWS-DEDICATED pre-rulebase security rules APP1-NLB-WEB log-start no
set device-group CLD-DG-AWS-DEDICATED pre-rulebase security rules APP1-NLB-WEB log-end yes
